```json
{"thought":"The superpower table doesn't exist in the database. From the JSON file, I know Super Strength has id=18. Let me query heroes with this power and join with superhero table.","action":"execute_context_sql","action_input":{"path":"db/hero_power.db","sql":"SELECT hp.hero_id FROM hero_power hp WHERE hp.power_id = 18"}}
```

```json
{"thought":"I have 200 heroes with Super Strength. Now I need to count how many have height_cm > 200.","action":"execute_context_sql","action_input":{"path":"db/hero_power.db","sql":"SELECT COUNT(*) FROM hero_power hp JOIN superhero s ON hp.hero_id = s.id WHERE hp.power_id = 18 AND s.height_cm > 200"}}
